/E (Barking Dog Bookstore is an independent bookstore concept built around community, discovery, and the joy of reading. The goal was to create a warm, approachable brand identity that captured the personality of a neighborhood bookstore while incorporating a playful connection to rescue dogs and reflective of the personality found within a neighborhood bookstore.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
